$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=tmgamfn  LOC_AFTER=?

* The stack-alphabet function of the machine layer is a function on the eight stack indices.  Lean (TM/Frag.lean): ` abbrev K := Fin 8 ` , ` abbrev Gamma : K -> Type := fun _ => Gamma' ` .

s1::gammaex |- Gamma' e. _V
i2::fnconstg
s3:s1,i2:ax-mp |- ( ( 0 ..^ 8 ) X. { Gamma' } ) Fn ( 0 ..^ 8 )
s4::df-tmgam |- TMGam = ( ( 0 ..^ 8 ) X. { Gamma' } )
s5:s4:fneq1i |- ( TMGam Fn ( 0 ..^ 8 ) <-> ( ( 0 ..^ 8 ) X. { Gamma' } ) Fn ( 0 ..^ 8 ) )
qed:s5,s3:mpbir |- TMGam Fn ( 0 ..^ 8 )
$)
